<title>USA: LoJack Q2 net rises, shr flat.</title>
<headline>LoJack Q2 net rises, shr flat.</headline>
<dateline>DEDHAM, Mass. 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>LoJack Corporation</p>
<p>			 Condensed Financial Information</p>
<p>	   Three Months Ended,		  Six Months Ended</p>
<p>		   August 31,			  August 31,</p>
<p>			1996	  1995	    1996	  1995</p>
<p> Revenues   $15,910,000 $13,491,000   $30,915,000 $25,324,000</p>
<p>Operating Income</p>
<p>before depreciation</p>
<p>and amortization</p>
<p>		  4,023,000   2,760,000     7,370,000   4,901,000</p>
<p>Pre-Tax Income</p>
<p>		  3,868,000   2,427,000     7,043,000   4,208,000</p>
<p> Net Income 2,360,000  2,245,000(A)   4,297,000  3,866,000(A)</p>
<p> Per share:	   .10	.10(A)	     .18	.17(A)</p>
<p>Weighted average number</p>
<p>of common and common</p>
<p>equivalent shares</p>
<p>outstanding</p>
<p>		 23,082,000  23,337,000    23,184,000  23,108,000</p>
<p>(A) Includes recognition of $765,000 and $1,299,000 of net operating loss carryforwards in the three and six month periods ending August 31, 1995, representing $.04 and $.06 per share respectively. SOURCE  LoJack Corporation</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
